{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121138","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121138/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121138/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121138/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121138","id":4847948534,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7v0Cja","number":121138,"title":"Fix K2 lens distortion coefficient in GLES3 blit","user":{"login":"xczcxczxzcz","id":283870210,"node_id":"U_kgDOEOuEAg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/283870210?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xczcxczxzcz","html_url":"https://github.com/xczcxczxzcz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xczcxczxzcz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xczcxczxzcz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xczcxczxzcz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xczcxczxzcz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xczcxczxzcz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xczcxczxzcz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xczcxczxzcz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xczcxczxzcz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xczcxczxzcz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-07-09T16:13:51Z","updated_at":"2026-07-13T15:45:15Z","closed_at":"2026-07-13T15:44:20Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121138","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121138","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121138.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121138.patch","merged_at":"2026-07-13T15:44:20Z"},"body":"`CopyEffects::copy_with_lens_distortion` (`drivers/gles3/effects/copy_effects.cpp`) uploaded the `K2` shader uniform from `p_k1` instead of `p_k2`. `p_k2` was passed in and used nowhere else in the function.\r\n\r\nThe lens shader applies a two-term radial model (`drivers/gles3/shaders/effects/copy.glsl`):\r\n\r\n```glsl\r\nfloat distortion_scale = 1.0 + (k1 * radius_sq) + (k2 * radius_s4);\r\n```\r\n\r\n`k1` scales the r² term and `k2` scales the r⁴ term. With `K2` receiving `k1`, the r⁴ term used the wrong coefficient, so any lens profile with a nonzero `k2` produced an incorrect warp.\r\n\r\nThe caller passes the two coefficients separately and only takes this path when `k2` is set (`drivers/gles3/rasterizer_gles3.cpp`):\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\nif (p_blit.lens_distortion.apply && (p_blit.lens_distortion.k1 != 0.0 || p_blit.lens_distortion.k2)) {\r\n    copy_effects->copy_with_lens_distortion(..., p_blit.lens_distortion.k1, p_blit.lens_distortion.k2, ...);\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis runs on the XR/VR blit-to-screen path, once per eye per frame, on the Compatibility renderer.\r\n\r\nI could not capture the visual result: it needs a headset, which I do not have.\r\n\r\nIntroduced in 37b7f577ad (\"Fix GLES3 stereo output (sRGB + lens distortion)\"), so this likely wants a 4.5 backport.\r\n\r\n* *Bugsquad edit, fixes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121213*","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121138/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121138/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}